Strongman means lifting stones, flipping tyres and carrying loads most of us would not try to move without a trolley. Our ambassador Jasmine Marsters competes in NZ Strongman, and her body takes all of it.

Heavy lifting loads the lower back, hips, knees and grip far beyond everyday life. For Jasmine, recovery is not optional. It is part of the training. {JASMINE_RECOVERY}

